# Storyteller .dockerignore
#
# Build contexts for compose: ., ./infra/api (LARAVEL_ENV_FILE context).
# Excluding node_modules at the context level keeps the COPY lean and
# sidesteps Docker's symlink-outside-context validation that breaks on
# `packages/design-system/node_modules/.bin/esbuild`.

**/node_modules
**/vendor
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.kilo
**/.vite
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/.next

# Agent scratch
**/__test*
**/tmp-vitest*

# Docker artefacts (don't recurse into them again)
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
